Wenxuan Zhou, Ravi Agrawal, Shujian Zhang, Sathish Reddy Indurthi, Sanqiang Zhao, Kaiqiang Song, Silei Xu, and Chenguang Zhu.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Wpo: Enhancing rlhf with weighted preference optimization.

</span>
